## Page Types

The website contains four page types:

### 1. Knowledge Node
The main content page.
Each Knowledge Node represents one educational YouTube video.

### 2. Homepage
The main entry page of the knowledge library.

The Homepage includes:
- a brief introduction to the library
- navigation to all Knowledge Centers
- the site's search bar

### 3. Knowledge Centers
Topic pages that group all Knowledge Nodes related to a specific medical subject.

Examples include:
- Fertility & IVF
- Menopause
- Pregnancy & Birth
- Contraception
- Gynecology

A single Knowledge Node may belong to more than one Knowledge Center.

### 4. Medical Disclaimer
A standalone page containing the complete medical disclaimer.

Every Knowledge Node contains a link to this page, allowing users to access the full disclaimer without repeating the entire text on every Node.